B.aDS=new A.EX("Snip titles give each OneNote paragraph a ~5-word bold AI title. Sort Suggestions only ever offer a chip \u2014 nothing moves on its own. Extra words in a note (the TV, a phone call, other people, your own stray words) are only pointed out \u2014 nothing is removed until you tap.",null)
B.aDT=new A.EX("The number on the right is what each one used today.",null)
B.aDU=new A.EX('AI Find Garbage overnight reads your notes on a PC from 1:00 AM, a few cents a night, and only marks what it finds - the bin in each list shows it. Each command counts the notes it would do and shows the cost and the time before it starts. Hidden is always left out. One folder: "AI Rewrite Folder Dictations\u2026" and "Suggest folders for these notes\u2026" in its \xb7\xb7\xb7 menu.',null)
B.aDV=new A.EX("These cover notes from now on and never touch the notes you already have. The AI helps; nothing is replaced without you. A rewrite is made when you stop dictating; your words are always kept and one tap away, and an AI title can be undone on the note. A folder can set its own in its \xb7\xb7\xb7 menu. Long recordings always show your words.",null)
